╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│Help                                                                                          │
│──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────│
││ Panes:                                                                                      │
││ ────────────────────────────────────────────────                                            │
││   ?                     Open this help reference                                            │
││   Space                 Open task workspace                                                 │
││   Q                     Open operation queue                                                │
││   B                     Open board view selector                                            │
││   L                     Open event log                                                      │
││   N                     Open notification action center                                     │
││   O                     Open tmux sessions                                                  │
││   D                     Open system diagnostics                                             │
││   n                     Open async failure recovery                                         │
││   s                     Open settings                                                       │
││   c                     Open create task form                                               │
││   X                     Open bulk cleanup                                                   │
││   f                     Open filter menu                                                    │
││   ,                     Open sort menu                                                      │
││   /                     Open search                                                         │
││   g then p              Open project selector                                               │
││   g then s              Open spec workspace                                                 │
││                                                                                             │
││ Navigation:                                                                                 │
││                                                                                             │
││ [j/k/ctrl+u/d to scroll, g/G to jump]                                                       │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯